---
// Ill02PoolingMachine.astro
// Visual brief: From 1,000 Humans to One Capital Machine
---

<div class="my-10 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900/90 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 bg-slate-100/60 dark:bg-navy-950/60 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-semibold">Editorial Visual 02</div>
      <h3 class="text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-semibold m-0">From 1,000 Humans to One Capital Machine</h3>
    </div>
    <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 rounded border border-blue-500/20 font-medium">Coordination Technology</span>
  </div>

  <div class="p-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-stretch gap-4">
      <!-- Input Pool -->
      <div class="flex-1 p-5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 flex flex-col justify-center text-center">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Retail Inefficiency</div>
        <div class="text-xl font-bold font-mono text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">1,000 Investors</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">₹1 Crore contributed each</div>
        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-navy-700 flex justify-center items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">
          <span>Total Pool: ₹1,000 Cr</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Arrow -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 rotate-90 md:rotate-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
      </div>

      <!-- Engine -->
      <div class="flex-1 p-5 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-navy-950 text-white border border-slate-800 flex flex-col">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase font-semibold text-amber-400">The Intermediary Machine</div>
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mt-1">AIF / Investment Manager</div>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span> Institutional Research</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span> High-Frequency Execution</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span> Enterprise Risk Systems</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span> Regulatory & Custody Rails</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Arrow -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-600">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6 rotate-90 md:rotate-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg>
      </div>

      <!-- Output -->
      <div class="flex-1 p-5 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/50 flex flex-col justify-center text-center">
        <div class="text-xs uppercase font-semibold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Target Asset</div>
        <div class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">Institutional Portfolio</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Unlisted shares, derivatives, debt & secondary blocks</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-100/50 dark:bg-navy-950/40 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs italic text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 m-0">Pooling is a technology. The fund exists because thousands of investors cannot efficiently behave like one institution.</p>
  </div>
</div>
